  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 710.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish procedures and criteria for the monitoring of radionuclides in drinking water.\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #12668, eff 1-1-19",
